{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321202001:1":{"text":"어! 저쪽에 눈사람이 있어!","source_cn":"啊！那边有个雪人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x921D3ED061E446ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321202002:1":{"text":"눈사람이 중얼거리는 소리를 들은 것 같은데...","source_cn":"我好像听到它在说话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C60D0A373E83DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321202003:1":{"text":"왠지 낯이 익어.","source_cn":"看着有些眼熟啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B37614B51677709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321202004:1":{"text":"아! 생각났다. 제전에서 봤던 그 눈사람이잖아!","source_cn":"啊！我想起来了，这不是祭典上面的那个雪人吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE17BC716812B984B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321202005:1":{"text":"그 마법사가 눈사람을 엄청나게 많이 활성화시켰잖아... 이름이 뭐더라?","source_cn":"那个魔法师激活了好多雪人……叫什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AF63CF78EF07A2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321202006:1":{"text":"비츠와프! 마법을 함부로 쓰는 바람에 눈사람들을 폭주하게 만들었잖아!","source_cn":"——维茨瓦夫！乱用魔法让雪人们都狂化了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689FF20A85D116DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321202007:1":{"text":"이곳이 황량해서 다행이지, 그때 그 난폭한 눈사람은 너무 위험했어.","source_cn":"幸好这里荒郊野岭，当时那些狂暴的雪人，太容易伤人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84EB9E5AC9483C25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321202008:1":{"text":"마스터, 어서 잘못된 마법을 제거하도록 해요!","source_cn":"主人，我们得赶紧消除它身上错误的魔法！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A3F55332635E52E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 어서 잘못된 마법을 제거하도록 해요!","female":"마스터, 어서 잘못된 마법을 제거하도록 해요!","variant_male_record_index":"145134","variant_female_record_index":"145135","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321202009:1":{"text":"뭐지? 인간이야... 게다가 말을 하는 쥐 두 마리까지! 들켜버렸어!","source_cn":"什么？有人类……还有两只会说话的老鼠！咱被发现了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F46EC339817D4B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321202010:1":{"text":"어서 도망쳐! 아직 꽃을 보지도 못했는데 여기서 붙잡힐 순 없어.","source_cn":"快跑快跑！咱还没见过花呢！可不能在这里被逮到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x582B8F1C93DDD3E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1321201001:":{"text":"여기도 들꽃이 없어...","source_cn":"这里怎么也没有野花啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A3A07129BD7293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1321201002:":{"text":"눈생 참 힘드네~","source_cn":"雪生艰难啊~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BEA87D3D1567628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1321201003:":{"text":"녹아버리기 전에 꼭 봐야 되는데!","source_cn":"在化掉前，一定要看到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E908C56036EAC99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:13021211:0":{"text":"제전에서 도망친 눈사람 하나를 발견했다. 하지만 실수로 그를 놀라게 해 도망치게 만들었다.","source_cn":"你们在野外遇到一只从祭典上逃跑的雪人，却不小心把它吓跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD794A65A9DFD4FE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雪人":{"text":"눈사람","source":"雪人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":4}}